{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c0a1f2e3-4d56-789a-bc01-e23456789012",
    "name": "Q10 OrderFlow - Architecture & Resilience Suite",
    "description": "Colección completa de pruebas transaccionales, consultas de almacén y resiliencia para el ecosistema microservicios Q10 OrderFlow (FastAPI + RabbitMQ + PostgreSQL).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Sistema & Catálogo de Inventario",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Healthcheck Orders API",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/health",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que el servicio FastAPI esté levantado y escuchando colas del broker."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar Catálogo y Saldo en Vivo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/products",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["products"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna los 4 productos cargados inicialmente (seed) y demuestra en tiempo real el saldo remanente tras las compras."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listado General de Pedidos (Polling target)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el historial cronológico de pedidos en PostgreSQL con el estado final (Pending, Confirmed, Rejected)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Flujos Exitosos (Event-Driven Confirmations)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear Pedido - 2 MacBooks Pro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_name\": \"Daniel Ramos (Prueba Postman Exito)\",\n  \"sku\": \"LAPTOP-PRO-16\",\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "Al crearse retorna código 201 Created y estado 'Pending'. En el segundo siguiente el Inventory Worker en RabbitMQ rebajará 2 MacBooks en PostgreSQL y cambiará el estado a 'Confirmed'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear Pedido - 1 Smartphone Samsung S24",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_name\": \"Empresa Q10 Tech Lead\",\n  \"sku\": \"PHONE-ULTRA-24\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Pruebas de Rechazo y Resiliencia (Casos Borde)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Rechazo Asíncrono - Saldo Insuficiente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_name\": \"Comprador Masivo (Excedente)\",\n  \"sku\": \"HEADPHONES-ANC\",\n  \"quantity\": 80\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "El inventario solo tiene 5 audífonos. El pedido se registra en Pending pero el Worker enviará StockRejected al broker de inmediato y cambiará su estado en BD a 'Rejected', manteniendo intactos los 5 audífonos reales."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Error 422 - Validación Pydantic (Cantidad Inválida > 100)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_name\": \"Intruso sin Contrato\",\n  \"sku\": \"LAPTOP-PRO-16\",\n  \"quantity\": 500\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna error HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity. Atrapado en la capa HTTP sin consumir recursos en la base de datos ni colas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Error 422 - Validación Pydantic (Cliente Vacío)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_name\": \"     \",\n  \"sku\": \"LAPTOP-PRO-16\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Error 404 - SKU No Existente en el Seed",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_name\": \"Daniel Ramos\",\n  \"sku\": \"SKU-INEXISTENTE-123\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/orders",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "El controlador verifica la tabla stock antes de actuar y retorna HTTP 404 informando que ese SKU no existe."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
